tpm2-pkcs11: tpm2-pkcs11 (PKCS#11 interface for TPM2 hardware)
tpm2-pkcs11:
tpm2-pkcs11: A PKCS#11 implementation for the Trusted Platform Module 2.0
tpm2-pkcs11: (TPM 2.0). It allows applications using the PKCS#11 interface to
tpm2-pkcs11: transparently use TPM 2.0 for cryptographic operations including
tpm2-pkcs11: key generation, signing, encryption, and decryption.
tpm2-pkcs11:
tpm2-pkcs11: Features include token objects backed by TPM 2.0 keys, support
tpm2-pkcs11: for multiple TPM 2.0 implementations, and FAPI-backed tokens.
